  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside the conference room, Qin Xiao catches up with fellow Media College alumnus Chun Yuqiao and asks to meet after work for advice. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于师兄，在学校的时候就听说过你的大名了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在可以一起共事，好开心啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "有空的话，我们可以一起坐坐吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我有好多事情想向师兄请教。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你喜欢喝咖啡是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司附近有一家店，那儿咖啡味道不错，你可以去尝尝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那师兄今天几点钟下班？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我胃不好，喝不了咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大拒绝人的办法越来越狠了啊。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "淳于师兄，在学校的时候就听说过你的大名了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior Yuqiao, I heard of your famous name back in college.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在可以一起共事，好开心啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Getting to work together now makes me so happy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is there something you need?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "有空的话，我们可以一起坐坐吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When you are free, could we sit down together?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我有好多事情想向师兄请教。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There are many things I would love to ask your advice about.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你喜欢喝咖啡是吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You enjoy drinking coffee, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司附近有一家店，那儿咖啡味道不错，你可以去尝尝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a place near the office with good coffee; you can go try it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那师兄今天几点钟下班？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what time do you get off work today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我胃不好，喝不了咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My stomach is weak, so I cannot drink coffee.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大拒绝人的办法越来越狠了啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our boss's way of turning people down keeps getting sharper.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
